"| Alice's bits   | 0       | 0       | 1       | 0       |  0       | ... |\n"
"|---------|----------|----------|---------|----------|--------|---|\n"
"| Alice's bases      | X       | Z       | X       | Z       |  X       | ...|\n"
"| Alice's states       | $\\vert +\\rangle$ | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert -\\rangle$ | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert +\\rangle$ |...|\n"
"| Bob's bases      | X       | Z       | X       | Z       | X       | X       | ...|\n"
